  "cue_count": 39,
  "cues": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start": 1.33,
      "end": 5.33,
      "text": "We hold these truths to be self-evident that all men and women are clearly equal.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.150174,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.046631
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 5.33,
      "end": 8.33,
      "text": "Just kidding. Sorry. No.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.150174,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.046631
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 8.33,
      "end": 13.33,
      "text": "We're not all equal. Inequality, in fact, gets a ton of attention these days.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.150174,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.046631
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 13.33,
      "end": 17.33,
      "text": "President Obama called it, quote, the defining challenge of our time.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.150174,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.046631
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 17.33,
      "end": 21.33,
      "text": "But usually, when people are talking about inequality, they're talking about income inequality.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.150174,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.046631
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 21.33,
      "end": 25.33,
      "text": "And income inequality is at its highest level since the Great Depression.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.150174,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.046631
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 25.33,
      "end": 29.33,
      "text": "Before taxes, a top 1% take home about 22.5% of the national income.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.150174,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.046631
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 29.33,
      "end": 31.33,
      "text": "Really think about that for a second.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.068989,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.016907
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 31.33,
      "end": 37.33,
      "text": "For every dollar paid in income in the US, almost a quarter of it goes to the top 1%, a quarter.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.068989,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.016907
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 37.33,
      "end": 42.33,
      "text": "But income inequality is actually less dangerous than its cousin, wealth inequality.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.068989,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.016907
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 42.33,
      "end": 45.33,
      "text": "The top 1% hold closer to 40% of the national wealth.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.068989,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.016907
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 45.33,
      "end": 49.33,
      "text": "So for every dollar in American assets, that's home, stock, savings, all that,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.068989,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.016907
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 49.33,
      "end": 52.33,
      "text": "40 cents of it belongs to the top 1%.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.068989,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.016907
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 52.33,
      "end": 58.33,
      "text": "The top 1% holds more wealth in America than the bottom 90% of the country combined.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.068989,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.016907
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 58.33,
      "end": 61.33,
      "text": "And a lot of that money gets passed on to their children, or their children's children.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.074439,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003273
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 61.33,
      "end": 64.33,
      "text": "Take the heirs of Sam Walden, founder of Walmart.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.074439,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003273
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 64.33,
      "end": 67.33,
      "text": "None of them founded Walmart. None of them were created equal.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.074439,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003273
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 67.33,
      "end": 70.33,
      "text": "Either the six of them have more than $140 billion in wealth.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.074439,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003273
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 70.33,
      "end": 75.33,
      "text": "That makes those six people wealthier than the bottom 40% of Americans combined.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.074439,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003273
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 75.33,
      "end": 78.33,
      "text": "Now, there's an upside to income inequality.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.074439,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003273
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 78.33,
      "end": 82.33,
      "text": "That income is a reward for people who start their businesses and do great things.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.074439,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003273
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 82.33,
      "end": 86.33,
      "text": "You can like income inequality, you can hate it, but at least it is money they earned in this lifetime,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.074439,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003273
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 86.33,
      "end": 90.33,
      "text": "usually through talent or risk or hard work, with a little bit of luck.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.088561,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00407
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 90.33,
      "end": 92.33,
      "text": "But wealth inequality isn't like that.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.088561,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00407
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 92.33,
      "end": 95.33,
      "text": "That money is often a reward for people who are born in a bright family,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.088561,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00407
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 95.33,
      "end": 97.33,
      "text": "and it's money that keeps growing.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.088561,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00407
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 97.33,
      "end": 101.33,
      "text": "That's a big point economist Thomas Piketty makes in his new book, Capital.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.088561,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00407
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 101.33,
      "end": 107.33,
      "text": "The rate of the return on capital or wealth is higher than the growth rate of the overall economy.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.088561,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00407
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 107.33,
      "end": 111.33,
      "text": "So people who have a lot of wealth, they tend to get wealthier and wealthier and wealthier",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.088561,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00407
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 111.33,
      "end": 114.33,
      "text": "unless something like a war or attacks intervenes.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.088561,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00407
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 114.33,
      "end": 117.33,
      "text": "One way they get wealthier, by the way, is politics.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.073363,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003765
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 117.33,
      "end": 119.33,
      "text": "A lot of money can buy you a lot of political speech,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.073363,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003765
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 119.33,
      "end": 124.33,
      "text": "particularly now that the Supreme Court is systematically dismantling the limits on buying political speech.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.073363,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003765
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 124.33,
      "end": 126.33,
      "text": "This is a doom loop of oligarchy.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.073363,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003765
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 126.33,
      "end": 129.33,
      "text": "Wealth buys power, power buys more wealth, more wealth means more power,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.073363,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003765
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": 129.33,
      "end": 133.33,
      "text": "more power means more wealth, and on and on and on we go until a very small fraction of the population",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.073363,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003765
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": 133.33,
      "end": 136.33,
      "text": "has a whole lot of the power and a whole lot of the money.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.073363,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003765
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": 136.33,
      "end": 139.33,
      "text": "So no, all men and women aren't born equal.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.073363,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003765
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": 139.33,
      "end": 142.33,
      "text": "Some are born really, really wealthy.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.073363,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003765
    }
  ],
  "created_at": "2026-11-12T19:12:19+0800"
}
